<title>UK: European precious metals close narrowly mixed.</title>
<headline>European precious metals close narrowly mixed.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Closed at $319.80/$320.30 down $0.80 after very quiet day. No evident direction since initial speculator and producer selling. Lending reflected in New York. Trend still down.</p>
<p>SILVER - Ended at $4.32/$4.34 up three cents. $4.40 resistance untroubled for second day. Getting bearish.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Finished down $2.50 at $403.00/$407.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Closed at $171.50/$175.50, up $6.00.</p>
</text>
